			"notes": "# :sparkles: Genyo 2.1.0 - Removed stats :sparkles: :exclamation::exclamation::exclamation: \n\nRemoved stats integration. It hasn't been working for a while, and it was completely pointless.\nAlso PenisESP finally works again.\n\n## New:\n- AutoPortal\n- MineESP\n- GyattESP\n- GenyoNuker\n- NoSwing\n- Command for turning off GenyoDiscord. The command is `.imapussy`. After using this command, you'll be able to force GenyoDiscord to be on all the time again, but you have to turn it on at the `Genyo` tab.\n\n## Fixes:\n- PenisESP's render has been fixed\n- SelfTrap, SurroundV2, AutoTrap are all working better - @Sleeepyv \n- Anticheat detection - @Sleeepyv \n\n## Changes:\n- Changelog in the title screen now works in a better way too\n\n## What's Changed\n* Pullreq @wuritz in https://github.com/wuritz/genyo-addon/pull/28\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wuritz/genyo-addon/compare/2.0.1...2.1.0"
